{"type":"thinking","text":"Now write SVG. Let's carefully generate.\n\nI'll include defs:\n- sky gradient\n- sun glow\n- hill gradients maybe\n- body gradient\n- wing gradient\n- helmet gradient\n- beak gradient\n- frame gradient maybe vertical\n- filter soft shadow\n\nNeed avoid setting fill on `<g id=frame>` and use stroke via use. Let's build.\n\nDetailed code:\n\n```\n<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 640\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"title desc\">\n<title id=\"title\">...</title>\n<desc id=\"desc\">...</desc>\n<defs>\n...\n</defs>\n<rect.../>\n...\n</svg>\n```\n\nBackground:\n- Ssky.\n- sun halo radial.\n- clouds with animation; use filters? Simple.\nCloud shape:\n```\n<g id=\"cloud1\" fill=\"#fffaf0\" opacity=\".72\">\n <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;22 -3;0 0\" dur=\"14s\".../>\n <ellipse cx=145 cy=102 rx=52 ry=23/>\n <ellipse cx=190 cy=92 rx=35 ry=20/>\n <ellipse cx=109 cy=94 rx=28 ry=16/>\n <rect x=110 y=102 width=100 height=20 rx=10/>\n</g>\n```\nIf rect border no. Use path with flat bottom. Better use ellipse group + rect with same fill, no stroke. Layer.\nClouds maybe white:\ncloud 1 x=130 y=110.\ncloud 2 smaller x=620 y=80.\ncloud 3 x=780 y=220 low.\n\n- Birds maybe 3 small dark strokes at (180,300) but background sky. Not needed.\n\nHills:\nback hill fill #b5d4c8.\nmid hill #95beaa.\nMaybe a band of ocean? Add distant water strip at y 440? Background could feel seaside. Let's do:\n- Far water line from y 425 to 500 with gradient #a8d2ce, but hills overlap? Not needed.\nSimpler hills.\n\n```\n<path d=\"M0 439 C 95 400 160 392 246 420 C 320 445 362 386 456 390 C 550 394 612 441 700 421 C 787 401 865 398 960 430 L960 520 L0 520 Z\" fill=\"#b9d7ca\"/>\n<path d=\"M0 477 C 130 451 236 468 354 485 C 482 503 597 465 710 473 C 817 481 889 491 960 477 L960 530 L0 530 Z\" fill=\"#9cc5af\"/>\n```\n- Foreground ground from 510:\n`<path d=\"M0 505 C 220 495 430 515 640 503 C 760 497 858 501 960 508 L960 640 L0 640Z\" fill=\"#d9c5a4\"/>`\n- Road path:\n`<path d=\"M0 516 C ... L960 640 L0 640Z\" fill=\"#cfb892\"/>` but if whole lower is road, okay.\n- Road top stripe line.\n- Dashes.\n\nShadow.\n\nDecor grass tufts at far left/right (x=70, 840) on verge around 505, animated none.\nFlowers.\n\nBike:\nDefs wheel. Use filter? outer.\n\nLet's define wheel with own static circles:\n```\n<g id=\"wheel\">\n <circle r=\"84\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2f3d40\" stroke-width=\"12\"/>\n <circle r=\"77\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#657477\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".55\"/>\n <g>\n   <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"0\" to=\"360\" dur=\"0.85s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n   <circle r=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a3aca9\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 16\" opacity=\".8\"/>\n   <g stroke=\"#e5ddcb\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" opacity=\".95\">\n     <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\"/>\n     <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\" transform=\"rotate(22.5)\"/>\n...\n   </g>\n   <circle r=\"63\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d4b56e\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n   <path d=\"M -5 -64 A 64 64 0 0 1 5 -64\" stroke=\"#f6c268\" stroke-width=\"5\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/> maybe not visible.\n   <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-72\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#ed8a3b\" stroke=\"#754622\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n </g>\n <circle r=\"14\" .../>\n <circle r=\"5\" .../>\n</g>\n```\nBut the outer dash circle rotates; same as spokes. Tire treads maybe.\nCould add colored wheel stripe (cream) to reinforce rotation? A wheel with a small orange dot does it.\n\n`<use href=\"#wheel\" x=\"285\" y=\"445\"/>` etc.\nNote anchor links in href likely. Fine.\n\nRear cog:\n```\n<g>\n <animateTransform type=rotate from=\"0 285 445\" to=\"360 285 445\" dur=.85s/>\n <circle cx=285 cy=445 r=17 fill=\"#425154\" stroke=\"#ddbd73\" stroke-width=3 stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n</g>\n```\nBut because rear wheel spinner already rotates, cog can be drawn separately. fine.\n\nChain:\n```\n<path d=\"M 490 419 L 285 430 M 490 491 L 285 460\" fill=none stroke=\"#384346\" stroke-width=4/>\n<path same stroke=\"#a7b0ab\" width=1.2 dashoffset animated??>\n```\nMaybe chain outline first, then dashed inside. animate both. Use:\n```\n<g fill=none stroke-linecap=round>\n <path d=... stroke=\"#303a3c\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n <path d=... stroke=\"#c7b483\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 5\">\n  <animate attributeName=stroke-dashoffset .../>\n </path>\n</g>\n```\n\nFar leg before chain/frame? If far leg behind chain, drawn before chain. But chain is at BB, far leg crosses. yes.\n\nFar leg:\n```\n<g opacity=\".85\">\n <path d=... stroke=\"#c9702c\" stroke-width=12 .../>\n</g>\n```\nNo outline? Add shadow filter.\n\nFar foot:\n```\n<g>\n <animateMotion ... path left start/>\n <path d=\"M -14 2 C ...\"/>\n</g>\n```\nMaybe feet are orange with darker outline and three toe lines. Add foot for near too.\n\nFrame use:\n```\n<g id=\"frame-shape\" ...>\n <path d=\"M400 332 L490 455\"/>\n ...\n</g>\n<use href=\"#frame-shape\" stroke=\"#0d393b\" stroke-width=\"17\"/>\n<use href=\"#frame-shape\" stroke=\"url(#frameGrad)\" stroke-width=\"11\"/>\n<use href=\"#frame-shape\" stroke=\"#7ec9b8\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".55\" transform=\"translate(-2 -2)\"/>\n```\nBut applying transform to highlight shifts all endpoints, slight offset. If `use` transforms, okay. Or use narrower full path no offset. Use same shape highlight with stroke-width=2 opacity .5. That creates center stripe rather than upper highlight. Could use two highlight segments separately. Simpler use center stripe #a8e0d1 width 2.5 opacity .65, nice tubing sheen.\nNeed fill none for use; define on group? `stroke-linecap` etc inherited. Use `<g id=\"frame-shape\" fill=\"none\">` no stroke. When use with stroke, paths inherit. Good.\nFrame should be behind chainring. Fine.\n- Seatpost separate lines after frame:\n`<path d=\"M401 334 L392 309\" stroke=\"#0d393b\" width=11; inner #b9c7c1 width=5/>`\n- Saddle after frame. Use fill gradient.\n```\n<g id=saddle>\n <path d=\"M 357 309 C 371 300 410 301 436 306 L 455 312 C 443 321 412 322 384 319 C 370 318 361 314 357 309 Z\" fill=\"#714d36\" stroke=\"#3d2b21\" stroke-width=2/>\n <path d=\"M 365 308 C... \" stroke=\"#b38258\" width=2 fill none/>\n <circle cx=448 cy=312 r=2.5 fill=\"#e6bf70\"/>\n</g>\n```\nBut body will cover. Fine.\n- Chainring/crank after frame and far leg:\n```\n<g id=crank>\n animate rotate\n <circle ... chainring>\n <g spokes>...\n <line arms...\n <pedal groups...\n</g>\n```\nAt t=0 right arm to (528,455); left to (452,455).\nChainring teeth outer with dashed, fill maybe #d8b56a. To have rotation visible, teeth dashes and crank arms. Add five chainring cutouts? Use dark spokes.\n```\n<circle r=37 fill=\"#f3d48b\" stroke=\"#2f3a3b\" width=2/>\n<circle r=30 fill=\"#1d5f5d\"? no chainring should metallic; use `<circle r=29 fill=\"#f3e3b6\" stroke=\"#9a7635\" ...>` then 5 holes? \n```\nDesign: chainring outer disk cream #e7cd93, border #2c3b3e; 5 cutout slots dark? Use `<circle r=27 fill=\"#fbf0d1\"/>` and spokes.\nAt zoom, cartoony. Fine.\n- Spider 5 lines from hub to r=27 rotated 0,72,.. stroke #b58c43 width 5. But one line to right under crank arm. okay.\n- Chainring teeth dashed ring r=38 stroke #2f3a3b width 4 dash 3 5; inner circle fill #f7e9c5 stroke #bf9850 width 3.\n- Crank arm dark outline and gold.\n- Pedals: at 528 and 452, outer groups translate, inner counter-rotate, rect 30x8 fill #2e3b3d, highlight. Foot covers.\n- center hub circle.\n\nNear leg:\nDraw path, then foot. No outline but filter `url(#legShadow)`:\ndefs filter:\n```\n<filter id=\"legShadow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"1.5\" flood-color=\"#8b451f\" flood-opacity=\".45\"/>\n</filter>\n```\nApply to leg. Foot separately.\nNear leg stroke #ef9238 width 13, with maybe little dark line? Add `stroke=\"#ef9238\"` + top highlight can't. Fine.\nAt hip add small cream feather scallop over top to hide. Since body drawn after leg, no need.\n\nBody:\nUse filter softDropShadow:\n```\n<g filter=\"url(#bodyShadow)\">\n <path body ...\n ...\n</g>\n```\nBut if body has filter, and wing inside later maybe separate. Use filter on body group; note filters expensive but fine.\nBody path fill url(#bodyGrad), stroke #c3b69f 2.\nTail feather shapes behind body (draw before body). place in body group? Draw tail first then body. \nFeather details:\n- `<path d=\"M385 286 C 420 305 460 309 500 296\" ... stroke=\"#d9ccb6\" opacity=.7/>`\n- lower belly shadow path maybe.\n- Little breast curve.\n- On ","truncated":true}
{"type":"tool_call","callId":"call_00_llKSnrVS1wAMtXdy97lA8340","tool":"write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/vellery-dkfy_wyb/work/pelican.svg","content":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 640\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"pelicanTitle pelicanDesc\">\n  <title id=\"pelicanTitle\">A pelican riding a bicycle</title>\n  <desc id=\"pelicanDesc\">An animated, side-view illustration of a cheerful pelican in a red helmet, seated on the saddle of a teal bicycle. The pelican grips the handlebars with one wing and pedals while the wheels, cranks, chain, and road markings move.</desc>\n\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"sky\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#f8eedc\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.42\" stop-color=\"#f7e2c8\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.72\" stop-color=\"#d9ece7\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#c1dedd\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <radialGradient id=\"sunGlow\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"50%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0.32\" stop-color=\"#f7c463\" stop-opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#f7c463\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n    </radialGradient>\n\n    <linearGradient id=\"road\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#d9c6a4\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.55\" stop-color=\"#cdb68f\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#bfa67d\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <linearGradient id=\"frameGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#23817b\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.55\" stop-color=\"#135e5d\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0f4d50\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <linearGradient id=\"bodyGrad\" x1=\"0.2\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0.65\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#fffdf6\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.58\" stop-color=\"#fbf3e2\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#e7dcc8\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <linearGradient id=\"wingGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0.8\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#fffdf7\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.55\" stop-color=\"#f5edde\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#d9cdb9\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <linearGradient id=\"helmetGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0.45\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#f07b58\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.62\" stop-color=\"#df5d43\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#bd4634\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <linearGradient id=\"beakGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0.3\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#f7a43b\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.7\" stop-color=\"#f8b44e\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#efa036\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <linearGradient id=\"pouchGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0.65\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#ffc05c\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.55\" stop-color=\"#f9ac42\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#e98d2f\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <linearGradient id=\"saddleGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#9b6e49\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#65442f\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n\n    <filter id=\"bodyShadow\" x=\"-25%\" y=\"-25%\" width=\"150%\" height=\"150%\">\n      <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"7\" stdDeviation=\"7\" flood-color=\"#6a543c\" flood-opacity=\"0.20\"/>\n    </filter>\n\n    <filter id=\"legShadow\" x=\"-30%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"160%\" height=\"140%\">\n      <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"2\" stdDeviation=\"1.4\" flood-color=\"#86461f\" flood-opacity=\"0.42\"/>\n    </filter>\n\n    <filter id=\"bikeShadow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n      <feDropShadow dx=\"0\" dy=\"4\" stdDeviation=\"3\" flood-color=\"#4f4c3e\" flood-opacity=\"0.22\"/>\n    </filter>\n\n    <g id=\"wheel\">\n      <circle r=\"85\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2e3d40\" stroke-width=\"12\"/>\n      <circle r=\"77.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6d7c7d\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n      <circle r=\"70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d2a2c\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\"0.60\"/>\n      <g>\n        <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"rotate\" from=\"0\" to=\"360\" dur=\"0.85s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n        <circle r=\"80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#96a3a0\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 17\" opacity=\"0.8\"/>\n        <g stroke=\"#e7dfcd\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" opacity=\"0.95\">\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\"/>\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\" transform=\"rotate(22.5)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\" transform=\"rotate(45)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\" transform=\"rotate(67.5)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\" transform=\"rotate(90)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\" transform=\"rotate(112.5)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\" transform=\"rotate(135)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"0\" y1=\"-65\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"65\" transform=\"rotate(157.5)\"/>\n        </g>\n        <circle r=\"63\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#d7b86f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        <path d=\"M -5 -63 A 63 63 0 0 1 5 -63\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f8ca77\" stroke-width=\"5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"-70\" r=\"4.5\" fill=\"#ee8e3c\" stroke=\"#774620\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/>\n      </g>\n      <circle r=\"14\" fill=\"#334448\" stroke=\"#d7b86f\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n      <circle r=\"5\" fill=\"#f1c369\"/>\n    </g>\n\n    <g id=\"frameShape\" fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n      <path d=\"M 400 329 L 490 455\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 403 334 L 625 323\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 285 445 L 490 455\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 285 445 L 400 329\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 635 380 L 690 445\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 625 323 L 635 380\"/>\n      <path d=\"M 490 455 L 635 380\"/>\n    </g>\n  </defs>\n\n  <!-- Sky and sun -->\n  <rect width=\"960\" height=\"640\" fill=\"url(#sky)\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"810\" cy=\"126\" r=\"122\" fill=\"url(#sunGlow)\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"810\" cy=\"126\" r=\"48\" fill=\"#f7bd5e\"/>\n  <circle cx=\"810\" cy=\"126\" r=\"38\" fill=\"#fbcf78\" opacity=\"0.45\"/>\n\n  <!-- Clouds -->\n  <g fill=\"#fffaf0\" opacity=\"0.72\">\n    <g>\n      <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0; 20 -3; 0 0\" dur=\"15s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"spline\" keySplines=\"0.45 0 0.55 1; 0.45 0 0.55 1\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"145\" cy=\"101\" rx=\"56\" ry=\"23\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"190\" cy=\"90\" rx=\"36\" ry=\"20\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"109\" cy=\"94\" rx=\"29\" ry=\"17\"/>\n      <rect x=\"108\" y=\"92\" width=\"112\" height=\"27\" rx=\"13\"/>\n    </g>\n    <g opacity=\"0.78\">\n      <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0; -18 2; 0 0\" dur=\"18s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"spline\" keySplines=\"0.45 0 0.55 1; 0.45 0 0.55 1\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"605\" cy=\"82\" rx=\"42\" ry=\"17\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"637\" cy=\"73\" rx=\"28\" ry=\"15\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"578\" cy=\"75\" rx=\"22\" ry=\"12\"/>\n      <rect x=\"579\" y=\"75\" width=\"83\" height=\"21\" rx=\"10\"/>\n    </g>\n    <g opacity=\"0.55\">\n      <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0; 12 2; 0 0\" dur=\"20s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" calcMode=\"spline\" keySplines=\"0.45 0 0.55 1; 0.45 0 0.55 1\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"420\" cy=\"196\" rx=\"46\" ry=\"15\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"451\" cy=\"188\" rx=\"25\" ry=\"13\"/>\n      <ellipse cx=\"390\" cy=\"190\" rx=\"21\" ry=\"10\"/>\n      <rect x=\"390\" y=\"188\" width=\"86\" height=\"21\" rx=\"10\"/>\n    </g>\n  </g>\n\n  <!-- Distant landscape -->\n  <path d=\"M 0 441 C 88 405 166 392 248 421 C 326 448 370 390 456 392 C 548 394 611 442 702 422 C 792 402 873 399 960 431 L 960 525 L 0 525 Z\" fill=\"#b8d6c9\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 0 478 C 121 453 238 466 351 485 C 477 505 587 465 708 473 C 821 481 889 491 960 478 L 960 535 L 0 535 Z\" fill=\"#9dc5af\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 0 498 C 160 486 336 501 493 493 C 656 485 814 495 960 503 L 960 538 L 0 538 Z\" fill=\"#88b39e\" opacity=\"0.65\"/>\n\n  <!-- Road and foreground -->\n  <path d=\"M 0 509 C 189 498 396 515 593 505 C 751 497 865 500 960 510 L 960 640 L 0 640 Z\" fill=\"url(#road)\"/>\n  <path d=\"M 0 510 C 189 499 396 516 593 506 C 751 498 865 501 960 511\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#a58c68\" stroke-width=\"4\" opacity=\"0.65\"/>\n  <path d=\"M -20 570 H 980\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f6e7c8\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-dasharray=\"72 108\" opacity=\"0.82\">\n    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"0\" to=\"-180\" dur=\"1.1s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n  </path>\n  <path d=\"M -30 604 H 990\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ad9570\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-dasharray=\"5 25\" opacity=\"0.55\">\n    <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"0\" to=\"-60\" dur=\"0.9s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n  </path>\n\n  <!-- Small roadside details -->\n  <g stroke=\"#6f937a\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" fill=\"none\" opacity=\"0."},"truncated":true}
