filter region may clip? `x=-30% y=-20% width=160% height=140%` around bounding box; dropshadow 2 px. At animation, bounding box changes; fine.\n- Body filter drop shadow creates visible shadow around body; nice.\n- Wing filter none.\n\nNeed perhaps test the chain and wheel animation speed. Can't visualize but good.\n\nCould use CSS animation to preview via creating a quick GIF with a custom renderer? rsvg doesn't animate SMIL. Could manually generate phase frames by manipulating and assemble a GIF to visually check motion. That might be worthwhile to catch any weirdness and also maybe produce confidence. We can generate 8 frames by parsing animation values and setting group transforms / foot positions. Use Python PIL to make an animated GIF or APNG, but not required for deliverable. We could inspect a contact sheet of phases. We did 45/90/180. Enough. We can maybe generate frames 0,45,90,135,180,225,270,315 and make a contact sheet of the leg area. Could inspect all to ensure no jumps. Do it, but not necessary. It may reveal issues with near leg/foot sync at 270 etc. Let's produce contact sheet quickly. Since we can manipulate values.\n\nNeed remember the image output final only. Could optionally use this to tune. Let's create 8-frame contact sheet at small size around rider. No need commit. Use correct translations:\nAngles and positions:\nnear at right start:\n0: (528,455)\n45: (516.87,481.87)\n90: (490,493)\n135: (463.13,481.87)\n180: (452,455)\n225: (463.13,428.13)\n270: (490,417)\n315: (516.87,428.13)\nfar opposite:\n0 (452,455), 45 (463.13,428.13), 90 (490,417), 135 (516.87,428.13), 180 (528,455), 225 (516.87,481.87), 270 (490,493), 315 (463.13,481.87).\nSet crank rotate same.\nAlso set chainring/crank and foot groups. For near/far identification based on initial transform strings. Generate each and contact sheet. Let's do."}
{"type":"tool_call","callId":"call_00_dhvCh2kk2bk0lx83LRUo1233","tool":"bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'PY'\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET, math, os\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw\nns='{http://www.w3.org/2000/svg}'\nET.register_namespace('', 'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg')\nphases=[]\nfor idx,(ang) in enumerate(range(0,360,45)):\n    rr=math.radians(ang)\n    nx,nY=490+38*math.cos(rr),455+38*math.sin(rr)\n    fx,fy=490-38*math.cos(rr),455-38*math.sin(rr)\n    tree=ET.parse('pelican.svg'); root=tree.getroot()\n    parent={c:p for p in root.iter() for c in p}\n    for p in root.iter(ns+'path'):\n        a=p.find(ns+'animate')\n        if a is not None and a.attrib.get('attributeName')=='d':\n            p.set('d', a.attrib['values'].split(';')[idx])\n    for am in root.iter(ns+'animateMotion'):\n        inner=parent[am]; outer=parent[inner]\n        old=outer.attrib.get('transform','')\n        if '452' in old:\n            outer.set('transform',f'translate({fx:.2f} {fy:.2f})')\n        elif '528' in old:\n            outer.set('transform',f'translate({nx:.2f} {nY:.2f})')\n    for g in root.iter(ns+'g'):\n        if g.attrib.get('id')=='crankAssembly':\n            g.set('transform',f'rotate({ang} 490 455)')\n    fn=f'/tmp/pelican-f{idx}.svg'; tree.write(fn, encoding='UTF-8', xml_declaration=True)\n    phases.append(fn)\n\nframes=[]\nfor i,fn in enumerate(phases):\n    png=f'/tmp/pelican-f{i}.png'\n    os.system(f'rsvg-convert -w 960 -h 640 {fn} -o {png}')\n    im=Image.open(png).crop((330,270,720,535)).resize((390,265))\n    d=ImageDraw.Draw(im); d.rectangle((0,0,80,23), fill=(255,255,255)); d.text((6,5), f'{i*45} deg', fill=(30,30,30))\n    frames.append(im)\nsheet=Image.new('RGB',(390*4,265*2),(240,235,225))\nfor i,im in enumerate(frames): sheet.paste(im,((i%4)*390,(i//4)*265))\nsheet.save('pelican-phases.png')\nPY","description":"Build contact sheet of eight pedal phases"}}
